, Panda Bear and Geologist. Later reissues of it were released under the name Animal Collective.","provider":"discogs","ref":"discogs:artist:207958","relations":{"aliases":[{"id":739936,"name":"Campfire Songs"}],"groups":null,"members":[{"active":true,"id":323620,"name":"Dave Portner"},{"active":true,"id":563743,"name":"Josh Dibb"},{"active":true,"id":985780,"name":"Noah Lennox"},{"active":true,"id":2083551,"name":"Brian Weitz"},{"active":true,"id":17443672,"name":"Croz Boyce"}],"namevariations":["AC","Anim'al Collective","▲nimal Collective","アニマル・コレクティヴ"]},"schemaVersion":2,"sourceUrl":"https://www.discogs.com/artist/207958-Animal-Collective","type":"artist","urls":["http://www.myanimalhome.net/","http://www.facebook.com/anmlcollective","http://twitter.com/anmlcollective","http://instagram.com/anmlcollective","https://anmlcollectve.bandcamp.com/","http://myspace.com/animalcollective","http://anmlcollective.tumblr.com/","http://www.songkick.com/artists/137427-animal-collective","http://www.dominorecordco.com/artists/animal-collective/","http://www.npr.org/artists/14993047/animal-collective","http://animalcollective.org/","http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Animal_Collective","http://www.whosampled.com/Animal-Collective/","http://soundcloud.com/anmlcollective","http://www.mixcloud.com/AnimalCollectiveRadio/","http://www.youtube.com/user/anmlcollective","http://www.youtube.com/user/AnimalCollectiveVEVO","http://vimeo.com/user9879860","http://www.dailymotion.com/AnimalCollective-vevo"]}},"/api/discogs/artist/31288/profile":{"cached":true,"profile":{"id":"31288","image":"https://i.discogs.com/r4UfmkeKORtWDIq7w_PiXnpTicSgKAVSsfUxtcO9V1Y/rs:fit/g:sm/q:90/h:596/w:600/czM6Ly9kaXNjb2dz/LWRhdGFiYXNlLWlt/YWdlcy9BLTMxMjg4/LTE3MDg5NTk1NDUt/NjcyNS5wbmc.jpeg","imageThumb":"https://i.discogs.com/DAVoykqViOzvQej5Yfbx3fGUW3_oGD5L9pwomLJdIkU/rs:fit/g:sm/q:40/h:150/w:150/czM6Ly9kaXNjb2dz/LWRhdGFiYXNlLWlt/YWdlcy9BLTMxMjg4/LTE3MDg5NTk1NDUt/NjcyNS5wbmc.jpeg","profile":"Live band project formed 